{
  "title": "Winey Pillowy German Mirin-Hon Bake",
  "description": "A comforting and indulgent German dish perfect for a lazy Sunday. This winey, pillowy bake is made with sweet Mirin-hon and features the tangy flavor of Nuka-pickle.",
  "cuisine": "German",
